<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY FOR MONDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY FOR MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of play on the top courts</p>
<p>at Wimbledon on Monday (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Centre court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>3-Jana Navotna (Czech Republic) v Gala Leon Garcia (Spain)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>3-Yeygeny Kalefnikov (Russia) v Jason Stoltenburg</p>
<p>(Australia)</p>
<p>Court One (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>8-Boris Becker (Germany) v Mark Petchey (Britain)</p>
<p>8-Aranxta Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v Florencia Labat</p>
<p>(Argentina)</p>
<p>13-Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) v Nicolas Kiefer (Germany)</p>
<p>Court Two (1000GMT)</p>
<p>12-Patrick Rafter (Australia) v Christophe Van Garsse</p>
<p>(Belgium)</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (France) v Maria Serna (Spain)</p>
<p>Court Three (1000GMT)</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) v Sandrine Testud (France)</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v John van Lottum (Netherlands)</p>
</text>
